###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The loss weights between energies and forces were not found in the text read. Table III is read as RMSE row (1.81, 1.64, 11.8, 13.17) and MAE row (0.79, 0.82, 6.38, 6.17) in the column order training, validation for energy then force.
# - The additional ACE potentials of the discussion (Table VI: other cutoffs, body orders and n_max, and a linear expansion) with their errors and costs are not encoded. 0 K phase properties (Table IV), defect energies (Table V), phonons, melting curve, liquid structure, viscosity and diffusion are not encoded.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
